    title: "go: a return-value-inferred receiver drops its external type before the module slot, so net.Conn.Read / net.Listener.Accept are unreachable and an idiomatic accept loop reports ZERO true receives (INV-linub L3 residual)"  # 549d
    status: todo_hard  # 549d
    priority: 1  # 549d
    parent: INV-linub-nokij-gibim-rovok-moros-gural-domip-rimof  # 549d
    tags:  # 549d
    - io_boundary  # 549d
